            "review_text": "Keepintouch93\nNha Trang, Vietnam12 contributions\n2\nAwesome and the best local restaurant\nAug 2017 • Friends\nThe restaurant look like a small market with a lot of seafood here and fresh either. Here you can look and choose by yourself some seafood that what you like. They sale by kilogram but you can take a half of kilogram or 300grs minimum then they will cook it for ya. Specially, that you can watch them cook some seafood alive for example ( lobster, crabs, grouper fish....). I had an awesome dinner with my friends here. And you? What is your \"cup of tea\"?\nRead more\nWritten August 1, 2017",
